			"id":"b2b2dc00d6d6c0fd",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Start of Turn\n### Hunter's Mark\n#### Use Cost (Bonus Action)\n3x Free Uses or 1st Level Spell Slot\n- Recharge on Long Rest\n\n#### Effect\nOnce per turn, deal +1d6 Force Damage on Marked Target\n- If marked target dies, Bonus Action to move to new target\n### Combat Superiority\n#### Use Cost (One / Attack)\n2x Superiority Dice (d6)\n- Recharge on Short or Long Rest\n\n#### Maneuver Options\n- **One:** ???\n- **Two:** ???\n",
			"styleAttributes":{
				"textAlign":null
			},
			"x":-520,
			"y":-360,
			"width":360,
			"height":686
		},
		{
			"id":"3aeb428a9e1e5ac9",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Recharge\n### Dusk\n#### Mistweaver\n- Recharge **Mistweaver**\n### Holy Dawn\n#### Jotun's Eye\nRecharge **Herald of Futures**",
			"styleAttributes":{
				"textAlign":null
			},
			"x":-520,
			"y":380,
			"width":360,
			"height":390
		},
		{
			"id":"4e54979a38fc400f",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Mistweaver\n1 charge, Recharges at Dusk\nHolds up to 30x **Arrows** in **Mist Quiver**.\n#### Mist Affinity\nExpend charge to cast **Misty Step**.\n#### Misted Arrow\nAs an attack, you can consume a charge to conjure and fire a special arrow made of mist. The arrow travels up to 60 feet, creating a curtain of mist in its trail before dissipating. This curtain extends downward to the ground, and **Heavily Obscures** anything perceived through it.\n\n  Creatures that attempt to pass through the curtain must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw equal to your Spell Save DC or become **Blinded** until the start of their next turn. You can allow any creature to automatically succeed this save.\n#### Misty Shot\nAs an Action, you can consume a charge to touch a willing creature and then choose a point within 300 ft. that you could theoretically hit with an arrow. The creature will be teleported to wherever the arrow lands. \n\n  Make a ranged attack roll (at **Disadvantage** if beyond 60-feet) If the result is over 15, you hit your intended target. Below 15, and the target is displaced 5-feet for every 1 under 15.\n",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":280,
			"y":-360,
			"width":760,
			"height":648
		},
		{
			"id":"c20c75d54e81d159",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Jotun's Eye\n#### Giant's Foresight\nWhenever you finish a **Long Rest**, roll three d20s and record the numbers rolled. You can replace any **D20 Test** made by you or a creature that you can see with one of these foretelling rolls. You can replace a roll in this way only once per turn. Each foretelling roll can be used only once. When you finish a **Long Rest**, you lose any unused foretelling rolls.\n#### Herald of Futures\nYou can cast **Divination** as a **Ritual** using the Jotun's Eye once per **Holy Dawn**.\n\n#### Tongue of Time\nYou learn **Giant**. You can telepathically speak to a creature you can see, but only in **Giant**. They hear your words as whispers in their mind.",
			"styleAttributes":{
				"textAlign":null
			},
			"x":280,
			"y":380,
			"width":760,
			"height":426
		},
		{
			"id":"57540624d9d1b61c",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# On hit Augments\n###### Stack 'em!\n### Hunter's Mark\n- +1d6 Force Damage (Once per Turn, Marked Target Only)\n### Dreadful Strike\n- +1d4 Psychic Damage (Once per Turn)\n### Weapon Mastery\n#### Vex (Recurve Bow)\nOn hit and damage with Bow, gain **Advantage** on next Attack Roll against that creature until end of next turn.\n#### Offhand (Handaxe)\nWhen you make an extra attack with an **Offhand** weapon as a result of using the weapon's **Light** property, you can add your ability modifier to the damage of that attack if you aren't already adding it to the damage.\n\n\n",
			"styleAttributes":{
				"textAlign":null
			},
			"x":-120,
			"y":-360,
			"width":360,
			"height":705
		},
		{
			"id":"8bc5c6143ea84779",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Short Rest\n### Health\nExpend to **Hit Dice** to Heal\n### Combat Superiority\nRegain expended Superiority Dice\n# Long Rest\n### Health\nRegain missing **Hit Points**\nRegain expended **Hit Dice**\n### Spells\nRegain expended Spell Slots\nChange One Prepared Spell\nRegain Free Uses of **Hunter's Mark**\n### Jotun's Eye\nRoll and Record new **Giant's Foresight** Rolls\n### Weapon Mastery\nChange Mastered **Weapons**",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-120,
			"y":380,
			"width":360,
			"height":780
		}
